# Level 0 host contract library

Generated from the NDP-02 contract. This project contains third-party identity
metadata and a no_std Rust library. Display names are in manifest.json, with
en-US and ja-JP and en-US fallback. No UI strings or translation engine are
implemented by this template.

PROVISIONAL: the SDK dependency uses a relative path into the caller-selected
repository checkout. Keep that checkout and its transitive crates available.
No published SDK or external distribution/pin scheme is assumed. The SDK Cargo
package version and the manifest SDK contract version are independent numbers.

manifest.json is App SDK JSON v1 metadata, separate from the M16 .xapp manifest.
The native entrypoint is a reserved package-relative locator. No executable at
that locator is generated by this library; validation does not check that it
exists or runs. Packaging and runtime adapters require later integration.

Optional developer checks, after separately preparing trusted tools/dependencies:

```sh
cargo check --offline --lib
nagi-pkg manifest validate manifest.json
```

Generation runs neither command and fetches nothing. A new library does not
ship Cargo.lock; pin/lock and package/target acceptance remain separate work.
Metadata validation grants no permissions and does not sign, install or launch
an app. See UNSUPPORTED_APIS.md. Host checks are not Nagi target acceptance.
